### `Verifying a gateway fix against a stale process`

|| Symptom | Cause | Fix ||
|| ------- | ----- | ---- ||
|| New gateway log lines never appear after a code change; behavior identical to before the edit | The running gateway is the pre-fix binary — source edited but never rebuilt/restarted | Compare process start + binary mtime to source mtime BEFORE reading logs: `ps -o pid,lstart -p "$(pgrep discursive | head -1)"`; `ls -l "$(go env GOPATH)/bin/discursive"`. If the process predates the edit, stop reading logs and ask the user to `go install ./... && discursive stop && discursive start`. ||

